## Parameter format

Parameters are passed inline using `name(value)` syntax, where `name` is the **parameter name** declared in the task:

  /<%=@task_name%> input_numbers(1,2,3)
  /<%=@task_name%> query(some text) lang(en)

Rules:
- Extract all `name(value)` pairs and pass them to the tool as named arguments
- `name` = parameter name (e.g. `input_numbers`), not the task name
- Everything outside the parentheses is context — ignore it when calling the tool
- If a required parameter is missing — return an error, never guess

